     rho^q U + V   = +525.6061   (published form)
     rho^2q U + V  = -525.6061   (corrected form)
  PASS  the published expression is POSITIVE, predicting H_b1 > H_a1 -- WRONG
  PASS  the corrected expression is NEGATIVE -- right
  PASS  the published value matches the reported -7196 + 5460 sqrt2   525.6061
  -- effect on the code: certify_tail tests rho^q |U| > |V| as the threshold.
     Since rho > 1 and q >= 0, rho^q|U| > |V| implies rho^{2q}|U| > |V|, so the
     code's threshold is CONSERVATIVE: the q it returns satisfies the correct
     condition too, hence p_cert remains valid (merely larger than necessary).
